{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872580/extras/07bb15b1d6220c3b166ef94d105b82f9.poster.avif?t=1761633305\" width=796 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872580/extras/07bb15b1d6220c3b166ef94d105b82f9.webm?t=1761633305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872580/extras/07bb15b1d6220c3b166ef94d105b82f9.mp4?t=1761633305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stackatalbi</strong> is a survival game where you stack cards to collect resources and craft new items. Drag your hero over an open world, hunt, fish, farm and grow stronger to fight new foes. Play solo or <strong>online co-op</strong> with a friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight, craft, explore</strong> using stack based mechanics.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872580/extras/ae78d1ab0822890da8a096a7e1b2f096.poster.avif?t=1761633305\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872580/extras/ae78d1ab0822890da8a096a7e1b2f096.webm?t=1761633305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872580/extras/ae78d1ab0822890da8a096a7e1b2f096.mp4?t=1761633305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card stack based resource gathering and crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world survival sandbox adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op gameplay option w